  "referenceNumber": "RUS1374",
  "remarks": "\nMikhail LEONTYEV (henceforth LEONTYEV) is the presenter of the Odnaki television show on Channel One, a television channel controlled by the Government of Russia. In this role, LEONTYEV has supported and promoted policies which have destabilised, and undermined the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
